Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1032-1033] Onigashima 39 - Oden_s Beloved Blade.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna roast ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Til you're well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Til you're well-done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Til you're well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gonna mince ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please take me straight to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.73,0:01:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Izo,\Nmaking me carry an injured man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that earlier news...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...about a giant specter appearing\Non the second floor caused me some alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, where'd it even come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard the castle is ablaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let up then, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get moving!\NThe monster's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those damn samurai\Nare blocking the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cannon... Bring a cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The castle's a living hell!\NSecure an exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid samurai...\Nkick their asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get outta here, or we're all toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:58.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a great deal for ya,\NYoung Master Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just hear me oooout!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:07.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo, at it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now you're thinking you're going to\Ngain favor with Yamato, are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for talkin' to you,\NYoung Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, Apoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, I am occupied!\NDo not follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It has been a while...\NBut I am pressed for time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:32.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time\Nfor frolicking around...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Castle Second Floor to all floors:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:40.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The giant flaming specter\Nis headed underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? A cushion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:52.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a head of hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whose, though?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:04.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fight it is, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ball of flame?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:21.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A nuisance...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So huuuuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The flame specter's intentions\Nremain unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuga, run! It comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The flame specter is descending!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is descending!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:01.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1717,216)}Dome Exterior\NZoro VS King
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:26.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that what happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.90,0:05:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...when he pulls on his crest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.45,0:05:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial Deep Pride...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:45.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it unblockable?!\NIt's basically a damn laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In ancient times,\Nthis is how the pteranodon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...hunted its prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, didn't know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've gotta land a hit on him somehow,\Nor all I'm gonna do is tire myself out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:24.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that flame on his back\Nalso comes with being a pteranodon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.05,0:06:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he is,\Ntalking to me from up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First things first:\Nknock him out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:07:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalasutra:\NGrand Dragon Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with this guy's\Nweird ass toughness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:26.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess dragons and dinos both\Nsoak up damage like nobody's business, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in my case, it goes even beyond that.\NYou could say I'm a little unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the\Nsword fight you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like swords, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:53.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've slashed him\Nmore than a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ultra...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,... Tiger Hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he ain't bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.73,0:08:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can flap his wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not just for show,\Nbut I can't be sure he can fly with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:16.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The flame on his back\Nis still burning...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thought that was part of\Nhis Devil Fruit power, but guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's got Fishman\Nor Giant's blood in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess it's some race\NI've never heard of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're searching for answers...\NYour eyes betray your confusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:42.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and I can't figure out what he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:51.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:17.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shamisen? Ain't no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enma's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sound of a shamisen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:09.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the midst of battle?\NWhat trickery is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it coming from\Nthe room next door?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-Is it the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:25.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one could possibly\Nbe holding a feast right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so bright...\NI can't see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ko... Komu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this the afterlife?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since that day, not a night has passed\Nthat I don't dream about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could I possibly forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:09.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot forget you, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:10.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...milord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am and always shall be,\Nby your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is a dream,\NI don't want to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!\NIt passes through the walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the abyss...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat, Castle Second Floor\Nto all floors:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The flame specter continues\Nits descent underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Descent"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:38.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(665,716)}Current\Nlocation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:33.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1250,900)}Armory
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That mustn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it keeps descending,\Nit will reach the armory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should that come to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it will ignite\Nthe massive pile of gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:51.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to help me\Nwith something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This way!\NCome with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:12:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What I would give for a moment's respite\Nupon this wonderful, soft bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.49,0:13:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we ought to be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The CP-0 agents are\Njust beyond the flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they'll be after us before we know it!\NLet's not tarry, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot run from us...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smile! I'm taking\Na commemorative photo for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Pets of the Celestial Dragons\Nat Kaido's Castle!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's a scoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:19.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll sell this story to Morgans,\Nfrom the World Economic Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can see the headlines now:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"The Government, After Losing\NTheir Broker Doflamingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Finally..."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Apoo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,X Drake...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:59.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think we don't know\Nwho you really are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:02.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, try coming up\Nwith a cover story!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:09.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inconveniences...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...must be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:29.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt, you stupid ass\NGovernment assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:39.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:40.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.81,0:15:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, ya think I wouldn't\Nuse Armament Haki, dumbass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:46.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make them pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you're Navy, aren't ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we doing this or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, they started it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're absolutely doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:34.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's it suddenly...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who said you could\Nunleash yourself without my permission?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Having a falling out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you trying now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:37.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you look down on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.07,0:17:52.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was the Pirate Hunter\Nyou had on the Snail, wasn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't no way\Nhe's winnin' against King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Close call...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:25.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If my Color of Arms was any slower,\NI would've been toast...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the size of that blast,\Nit was almost like he was trying to kill both of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How in the hell\Nis he still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:50.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a straight-up suicide attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's one of the last remaining Lunarians,\Na survivor of a race thought to be wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:19:02.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A race of monsters,\Nable to survive in any environment!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long ago, folks called 'em "gods"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd they end up wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! That's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you oughta look up\Nin a history book!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One-Sword Style, Draw:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:39.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Lion Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even a damn scratch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That attack was way stronger\Nthan the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shamisen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait, Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial Deep Pride Stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not now, Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First time I've seen a swordsman\Nheld back by his own sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.81,0:21:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kitetsu III!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A cursed sword, huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You idiot,\Nit ain't for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you die using it,\Nit'd be like I'd done the deed myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout this, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:22:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, how Kitetsu's countenance\Nhas changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would seem it has finally found\Nthe hands of a worthy owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kitetsu III you wield\Nis of my design.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:18.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You going to die,\Njust to save your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...\NOh, good. It didn't fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wado Ichimonji
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sensei!\NLet me have her sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye, very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get stronger,\Nfor both of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get so strong,\Nthe heavens'll know my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.81,0:23:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be\Nthe world's strongest swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.61,0:23:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enma, the blade Hiyori-sama\Nbestowed upon you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.11,0:23:31.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it perhaps feel\Nstrangely familiar in your grasp?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It works much like\Nany cursed blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weak cannot handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the most important reason\Nit has molded itself to your hand, by twist of fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is that Wado Ichimonji and Enma\Nwere forged by the same person!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The artisan,\NShimotsuki Kozaburo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:05.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It all happened so fast,\NI never really stopped to think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.82,0:24:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how'd a sword from Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.24,0:24:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...end up in the backwaters\Nof the East Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Completed your three-sword set?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial Slings and Arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.74,0:25:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.35,0:25:28.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enma...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sword from the Land of Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.78,0:25:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sword from Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.54,0:25:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zorojuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.95,0:25:45.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The word "Sunacchi"...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.46,0:25:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was warned to never say it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.21,0:25:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I learned it from an old man in my village\Na long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.84,0:25:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never said it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.47,0:25:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:02.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An old man in the village?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That old man\Nwho was always on the sea coast...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.41,0:26:20.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the longest time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.28,0:26:22.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.09,0:26:39.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1646,330)}East Blue\N13 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.38,0:26:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.59,0:26:39.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(609,567)}Isshin Dojo
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.38,0:26:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.09,0:26:41.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(977,306)}Shimotsuki\NVillage\N(Zoro's hometown)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.87,0:27:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.75,0:27:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis a word for good luck,\Nraises the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh...\NI dun need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.05,0:27:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Funny word.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.22,0:27:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you were a Samurai, weren'tcha?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone at the dojo said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.81,0:27:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Best they hold their tongues!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.43,0:27:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lest the Navy be upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:34.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(372,666)}The old guy\Nfrom the village
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.57,0:27:37.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy?! Why!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.07,0:27:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not say!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.53,0:27:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Off with ye, damned brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.28,0:27:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your problem,\Nya stubborn old fart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.00,0:27:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does the dojo bore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.42,0:27:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I lost to Kuina again!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.71,0:27:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta practice more!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.59,0:28:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.59,0:28:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't got money to pay with, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.89,0:28:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.98,0:28:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blunt as they are, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.77,0:28:14.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.40,0:28:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.19,0:28:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...cannot seem to forge\Nanything but junk in my old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use them for your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sword is like a kitchen knife,\Nbut for murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.29,0:28:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are designed to kill people!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.05,0:28:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A swordsmith hones their craft so that their weapons\Nare better at killing than any other!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every sword possesses\Nits own personality;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.81,0:28:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'tis a swordsman's lot to tame it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.39,0:28:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they label dangerous\Nswords "cursed"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.73,0:29:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!\NThat is the hallmark of a fine sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.65,0:29:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the weak fear it\Nand deem it "cursed,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.20,0:29:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it is rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.66,0:29:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...an honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.66,0:29:12.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Swords are fearsome...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.83,0:29:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...because they yearn\Nso deeply to be deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.17,0:29:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was one I forged\Nwhen I was young...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.76,0:29:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it was my greatest\Nstroke of genius...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.64,0:29:33.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sword had\Na serious temperament?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.39,0:29:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Twas such a fine blade,\Nit gave you chills merely from holding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.03,0:29:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And to it, I gave the name of\Nhell's mighty king!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell's mighty king...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.60,0:30:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Enma"!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.52,0:30:19.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My village was named Shimotsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.65,0:30:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess it wasn't a coincidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.23,0:30:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the day that old man died,\NI learned...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.03,0:30:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that he was Kuina's grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Catch me if you want\Nthis Excellent Grade Sword back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.42,0:30:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just a bamboo sword!\NGive it back, darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Did you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.89,0:30:58.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My grandma said this village\Nwas founded by a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.56,0:30:59.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.44,0:31:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pirate...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.15,0:31:07.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The artisan,\NShimotsuki Kozaburo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More than half a century ago,\Nhe unlawfully emigrated from this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.53,0:31:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That old man was a samurai\Nfrom the Land of Wano?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.75,0:31:21.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The swordsmith,\NShimotsuki Kozaburo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.21,0:31:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finer swords closely observe humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They select their swordsmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.01,0:31:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say the sword chooses the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.06,0:31:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You came to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.61,0:31:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because you chose me,\Nyou wanted to test me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.20,0:32:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sword is honest, direct...\NNot evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.63,0:32:09.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means it's my strength\Nthat's lacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.17,0:32:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So does this mean that\Neven with you draining a ton of Haki,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden wielded you like\Nyou were light as a feather?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.06,0:32:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I right, Enma?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.02,0:32:30.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he is!\NIt's Pirate Hunter Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.99,0:32:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he's all beat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.53,0:32:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us take his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.87,0:32:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we beat him, we'll get promoted!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.91,0:32:42.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me! I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.04,0:32:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.50,0:32:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to keep my Haki in balance?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.47,0:32:56.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm dead if I keep releasing\Nthis much Haki...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.49,0:33:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.37,0:33:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looking to become a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds great!\NThe world's greatest swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.00,0:33:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Pirate King won't settle\Nfor anything less!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.43,0:33:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cause I've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.89,0:33:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...promises to keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.89,0:33:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to my captain,\Nand to my best friend!
